@startuml selma_finding_lifecycle
' ============================================================
' Selma — Finding Lifecycle State Machine (NORMATIVE)
' Source:  SPECIFICATION.md §3.1, §3.2, §2.14
'          User_Stories.md S-11..S-14c, S-25, S-29, S-32, S-33
' C4:      Lifecycle Finder → Findings & Audit Trail Adapter → event_store
' Contract: 8.2.4
'
' Authority: ONLY fully normative FSM in the specification.
' Ownership, events, concurrency: docs/state-machine/README.md
' ============================================================

title Selma — Finding Lifecycle FSM\n<size:12><i>Normative 10-state · capability gates · SoD-1/SoD-2 · system-only close</i></size>

!include ./common/sm_styles.puml

[*] --> Created : <b>FindingCreated</b>\nactor: System (Rule Inspector)\ncommand: evaluation Fail | Partial | NeedsReview\nevent: FindingCreated

state "Created" as Created #3B7DD8 : **entry** born from inspection Report\n**allowed** system auto-open only\n**forbidden** human mutation · dismiss · waive
state "Open" as Open #3B7DD8 : **entry** disposition=valid decision hub\n**allowed** acknowledge | dismiss | waive\n**forbidden** close · approve · submit evidence\n**mutex** first action is exclusive
state "Acknowledged\n(In Remedy)" as Acknowledged #3B7DD8 : **entry** remediation accepted\n**allowed** evidence.submit\n**forbidden** dismiss · waive · close
state "Evidence\nSubmitted" as EvidenceSubmitted #1B7A6E : **entry** evidence actor recorded for SoD-2\n**allowed** system advance only\n**forbidden** human mutation
state "Pending\nVerification" as PendingVerification #B9770E : **entry** awaits Official decision\n**allowed** approve_remediation | reject_remediation\n**forbidden** evidence resubmit · close
state "Verified\n(Resolved)" as Verified #2C6E49 : **entry** remediation approved (pre-terminal)\n**allowed** system close only\n**forbidden** human close · reopen
state "Rejected\n(Reopen)" as Rejected #A93226 : **entry** remediation rejected\n**allowed** reopen + mandatory comments\n**forbidden** approve without reopen
state "Dismissed\n(Invalid)" as Dismissed #4A4A4A : **entry** disposition=invalid **terminal**\n**allowed** read-only / analytics\n**forbidden** any transition
state "Waived\n(Accepted Risk)" as Waived #B9770E : **entry** disposition=waived **pre-terminal**\n**allowed** system close only\n**forbidden** human close · reopen
state "Closed" as Closed #4A4A4A : **entry** terminal sink\n**allowed** read-only / analytics\n**forbidden** reopen · any mutation

Created --> Open : <b>system automatic</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: auto-open\nevent: DispositionChanged\naction: disposition remains valid

Open --> Acknowledged : <b>finding.acknowledge</b>\nactor: Compliance Representative\n[capability: finding.acknowledge]\nevent: DispositionChanged\nstory: S-12
Open --> Dismissed : <b>finding.dismiss</b>\nactor: Regulatory Official\n[capability: finding.dismiss]\naction: disposition := invalid\nevent: DispositionChanged\nstory: S-25
Open --> Waived : <b>finding.waive</b>\nactor: Regulatory Official\n[capability: finding.waive]\n[SoD-1: actor ∉ creator_provenance(control_id)]\naction: disposition := waived\nevent: DispositionChanged\nstory: S-29 / S-32

Acknowledged --> EvidenceSubmitted : <b>evidence.submit</b>\nactor: Compliance Representative\n[capability: evidence.submit]\naction: record evidence_submitter for SoD-2\nevent: DispositionChanged\nstory: S-13

EvidenceSubmitted --> PendingVerification : <b>system automatic</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: on evidence receipt\nevent: DispositionChanged

PendingVerification --> Verified : <b>finding.approve_remediation</b>\nactor: Regulatory Official\n[capability: finding.approve_remediation]\n[SoD-2: actor ≠ evidence_submitter]\nevent: DispositionChanged\nstory: S-14a / S-33
PendingVerification --> Rejected : <b>finding.reject_remediation</b>\nactor: Regulatory Official\n[capability: finding.reject_remediation]\nevent: DispositionChanged\nstory: S-14b

Rejected --> Open : <b>finding.reopen</b>\nactor: Regulatory Official\n[capability: finding.reject_remediation]\n[mandatory comments]\nevent: DispositionChanged\nstory: S-14c

Verified --> Closed : <b>system automatic</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: auto-close\nevent: FindingClosed
Waived --> Closed : <b>system automatic</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: auto-close\nevent: FindingClosed

Dismissed --> [*] : <b>terminal</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: sink\nevent: none
Closed --> [*] : <b>terminal</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: sink\nevent: none

@enduml
